{
  "_comment": [
    "Reference data for the shared `equipment` collection - the SmartDock boxes a",
    "school typically lends to faculty and students. The app NEVER writes these:",
    "create them once from the Firebase console (or the admin/tower side), using the",
    "object key as the document ID.",
    "",
    "Every item here is small enough to fit inside a SmartDock box and be sensed by",
    "the item-presence sensor. Bulky equipment (TVs, monitors) is not lendable",
    "through the tower and is deliberately absent.",
    "",
    "Field contract: name (String), category (String), boxNumber (Integer),",
    "status ('available' | 'borrowed'), borrowedBy (String uid or ''),",
    "borrowedByName (String or ''), borrowedAt (Long epoch millis or 0),",
    "dueAt (Long epoch millis or 0).",
    "",
    "The borrower app picks each thumbnail from `category` + `name`, so no image",
    "field is stored here. See EquipmentImages.kt for the keyword mapping."
  ],

